                        <summary/>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">           
                            <locus from="1ra" to="26ra"/>
                            <title type="incomplete">Apocalyptic treatise</title>
                            <note>The beginning is missing. In several places, there are quotations from the 
                                <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3179Revela">Apocalypse of St. John</ref> 
                                (<locus target="#8vb #11vb #13ra #14va #19ra"/>), indicated with <foreign xml:lang="gez">ዘእምራዕይ፡ ይቤ፡</foreign>.
                                The text is followed by what appears to be a 9-line formula of benediction, 4 lines of which have been scratched out.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez"><gap reason="lost"/>ፍዓ፡ መልአከ፡ ኀምስ፡ በቀርን፡ ወርኢኩ፡ ኮከብ፡ ወድቀ፡ እምሰማይ፡ ዲበ፡ ምድር። ወተውህበ፡ ሎቱ፡
                                መራሁቱ፡ ዐዘቅተ፡ ወመዓምቅ፡ ወአርገ፡ እምዐዘቅት፡ ጢስ፡ በከመ፡ ጢሰ፡ ዕጣን፡ ዐቢይ፡ ወጸልመት፡ ፀሐይ፡</incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">አነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ፈኖኩ፡ መልአኪየ፡ ኀቤክሙ፡ ከመ፡ ይኩን፡ ስምዓ፡ ይከውን፡ በዝንቱ፡ ነገር፡ ውስተ፡ ኵሉ፡ አቢያተ፡ ክርስቲያናት። አነ፡ 
                                ሥርው፡ ወዘመዱ<supplied reason="undefined" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> ለዳዊት፡ ወኮበብ፡ ዘይሰርቅ፡ በጽባሕ፡ ወመንፈስ፡
                                ወመርዓዊ። እወ፡ ይቤ፡ ነአ፡ ወዘይቤ፡ ይበውእ፡ ይቤ፡ ነዓ፡ ወጽሙእ፡ ይመጽእ፡ ወማየ፡ ሕይወት፡ ይነሥእ። <cb n="25vb"/> በከንቱ። አነ፡ እከውን፡ 
                                <sic>ስምዕ፡</sic> ለኵሉ፡ ዘይሰምእ፡ ነገረ፡ ዛቲ፡ ትንቢት፡ እንተ፡ ለዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፍ። እስመ፡ 
                                ዘ<supplied reason="undefined" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">ይ</supplied>ዌስክ፡ ላዕሌሆሙ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ይዌስካ፡ ላዕሌሆሙ፡ ቅሥፈታተ፡
                                ዘጽሑፍ፡ ውስተ፡ መጽሐፍ። ወዘየሐጽጽ፡ እምነገረ፡ ዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ለዛቲ፡ ትንቢተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ይእትት፡ መክፈ<pb n="26ra"/>ልቶ፡ እምዕፀ፡ ሕይወት፡ 
                                ወእምሀገር፡ ቅድስት፡ ውስተ፡ ዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፍ። ይቤ፡ ዘኮነ፡ ስምዓ፡ ከመ፡ ዝንቱ፡ ይእቲ፡ ትከውን፡ ወትመጽእ፡ ፍጡነ፡ ነአ፡ እግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ምስለ፡ ኵሎሙ፡ 
                                ንጹሐን፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን። <gap reason="ellipsis" unit="lines" quantity="5"/><gap reason="lost" unit="lines" quantity="4"/>
                                    </explicit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">         
                            <locus target="#26v"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2835RepCh119">Malkǝʾa Mikāʾel</title>                
                            <note>The text ends halfway through the third stanza. Another fragment of the same work is attested in 
                                <ref target="#ms_i4"/>.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">ሰላም፡ ለዝክረ፡ <choice resp="PRS8999Strelcyn"><sic>ስመ፡</sic><corr>ስምከ፡</corr></choice> 
                                <add place="below">ምስለ፡ ስመ፡</add> ልዑል፡ ዘተሳተፈ።</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i3">                                
                            <locus from="27ra" to="42vb"/>
                            <title type="incomplete">Apocalyptic treatise</title>
                            <note>The beginning and the end of the text are missing. In several places, there are quotations from the 
                                <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3179Revela">Apocalypse of St. John</ref> (<locus target="#32va #34rb #39rb"/>,
                                indicated with <foreign xml:lang="gez">ዘእምራዕይ፡ ይቤ፡</foreign>.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez"><gap reason="lost"/>ኢቃለ፡ ቀርን፡ ወቃለ፡ እንዚራ፡ ወኢይሰማዕ፡ እምኔሆሙ፡ ውስቴትኪ፡ ግሙራ። ወኵሎሙ፡ ገባርያነ፡ 
                                ግብር፡ ወኢይቅረ<surplus>ከ</surplus>ብ፡ ውስቴትኪ፡ ግሙራ፡ ወኢቃለ፡ ማኅረጽ። ኢይስምዕ፡ ውስቴትኪ፡ ወኢብርሃነ፡ ማኅቶ<cb n="27rb"/>ት። 
                                ኢይበርህ፡ ውስቴትኪ፡ ግሙራ፡ ወኢቃለ፡ መርአዊ፡ ወመርአት፡ ኢይስማዕ፡ ውስቴትኪ፡ ግሙራ። ወነጋድያንኪ፡ ወነገሥተ፡ ምድር፡ ወመኳንንት፡ ወኵሉ፡ አሕዛብ፡ 
                                ስሕቱ፡ ወስራይኪ፡ ወተረክበ፡ በውስቴትኪ፡ ደሞ<cb n="27va"/>ሙ፡ ለነቢያት፡ ቅዱሳን፡ ወኵሎሙ፡ እለ፡ ተቀትሉ፡ ዲበ፡ ምድር። ወእምድኅረዝ፡ ሰማዕኩ፡ ቃለ፡ 
                                ዐቢየ፡ ከመ፡ ቃለ፡ ሰብእ<choice resp="PRS8999Strelcyn"><sic>።</sic><corr>፡</corr></choice> ብዙኅ፡ እንዘ፡ ይብል፡ ሃሌ፡ ሉያ።
                                    </incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">ወካልእ፡ መልአክ፡ ኃያል፡ ጸርሐ፡ ወነሥአ፡ ዕብነ፡ ዐቢየ፡ ከመ፡ ዕብነ፡ ማኅረፅ፡ ወወረ<cb n="42vb"/>ውዎ፡ ውስተ፡ ባሕር፡ እንዘ፡
                                ይብል፡ ከመዝ፡ ድቀተ፡ ትደቅ፡ ባቢሎን፡ ሀገር፡ ዐበይት፡ ወይወግርዋ፡ ውስተ፡ አ<add place="below">ን</add>ቅት፡ ዐበይት፡ ወኢይረክብዋ፡ ግሙራ፡
                                ወኢይስማዕ፡ ውስቴታ፡ እምይእዜ፡ ቃለ፡ መሰንቆ፡ ወ<gap reason="lost"/></explicit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i4">                 
                            <locus from="43ra" to="43va"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2835RepCh119">Malkǝʾa Mikāʾel</title>                
                            <note>End of <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2835RepCh119">Malkǝʾa Mikāʾel</ref>, whose first three stanzas are attested
                                in <ref target="#ms_i2"/>. According to <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/N6HPGQK3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de l’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei: Fonds Conti Rossini et Fonds Caetani 209, 375, 376, 377, 378</title><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei</publisher><date>1976</date><series><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="page">325</citedRange></bibl>, the text is written by another hand.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez"><gap reason="lost"/> <expan><abbr>ሰ</abbr><ex>ላም፡</ex></expan> ለአጻብአ፡ ዕግርከ፡ ዕብነ፡ 
                                ጌጋይ፡ ዘኢያእቀፎ፡</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i5">
                            <locus from="43vb" to="45vb"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3588Miracle">Miracle of Mary: Miracle of a picture of Mary speaking to a
        worker</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">፩ ተአምሪሃ፡ ለእግዚእትነ፡ ማርያም፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወሀሎ፡ ፩ ብእሲ፡ ገባራዊ፡ ዘኮነ፡ ያወትር፡ ኵሎ፡ ዕለተ፡ ሰላማ፡
                                ለእግዝእትነ፡ ማርያም፡ ወ<pb n="44ra"/>ላዲተ፡ አምላክ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ሰርከ፡ ወነግሀ፡ ወመንፈቀ፡ መዓልት። 
                                ወነበረ፡ ከመዝ፡ ብዙኀ፡ መዋዕለ።</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i6">                
                            <locus from="46ra" to="69vb"/>
                            <title type="incomplete">Collection of prayers</title>
                            <note>The beginning and end of the text are missing. The prayer at the bottom of <locus target="#69vb"/> alludes to the 
                                <ref cRef="betmas:LIT1709Kebran.Chapter1"/>.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez"><gap reason="lost"/>ዋዐ፡ ወርቅ፡ እንተ፡ ወይን፡ ለጽምዕነ። እንተ፡ ታወፊ፡ ሕይወተ፡ ለነፍሳቲነ። ወትፄጉ፡ መድኀኒተ፡ ለደዌነ።
                                እንተ፡ ትሁብ፡ ብዕለ፡ ለነዳያን። ወክብረ፡ ለትሑታን። ኦመድኃኒቱ፡ ለአዳም፡ ወሙካፈ፡ መሥዋዕቱ፡ ለአ<cb n="46rb"/>ቤል። ወመብዝኅተ፡ አዝርእቲሁ፡ ለሴት።
                                    </incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">ኦዘመንክር፡ ምክረ፡ አብ፡ ለወልዱ፡ ለመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ። ንግበር፡ ዘይቤ፡ ሰብአ፡ በአርአያነ፡ ወበአምሳሊነ። ወዕፁብ፡ ምክረ፡ ወልድ፡ 
                                ዘሰምረ፡ በዝ፡ ምክር። ወአዳም፡ ስምረቱ፡ ለመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ዘተፈሥሐ፡ በግበረ፡ ዕደዊሆሙ። ኦዘመንክር፡ ወዕፁብ፡ <gap reason="lost"/></explicit>
